garage (2.4.1-2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Restart running garage@ instances on upgrade with try-restart. Stopped
    and disabled instances stay stopped.
  * tmpfiles.d declares /etc/garage as 0750 root:garage.
  * garage@.service: drop ReadWritePaths=/etc/garage and the redundant
    GARAGE_CONFIG_FILE.
  * Maintainer scripts handle the standard arguments. Add postrm.
  * Ship a DEP-5 copyright file and this changelog.

